        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "About Us\n \nAdministration\n \n \nThe company is also registered with the Tanzania Revenue Authority under the \n  \nTIN 169-422-168.There by making it legally recognized company andauthorised \n \nto operated in its ﬁeld of speciality as speciﬁed in the companies memorandum \nand article of association.\nThe Company was founded under a joint body by two directors;  \nNyeko Francis and Adolf Serete\nNYEKO FRANCIS:\nCurrently the head of Directors with a lot of knowledge and experience in the \nﬁled of Engineering speciﬁcally Civil and Mechanical . He is also actively involved \nin Lobbying for Contracts , General management and administration.\nADOLF SERETE:\nHe is a technical director with an immense level of experience in the technical \naspect that involves analysing all technical drawings and actively involve in the \ntechnical ﬁeld.\n1\nACTIVE TECHNICAL SERVICES LTD was registered on 18 th October, 2023 as a \nlimited liability company under the Companies act, 2002 of the laws of \nTanzania with the certiﬁcate Number 169422168.\n.\nACTIVE TECHNICAL \nSERVICES LTD.\nGIFT 0F GOD\nATS",
      "char_count": 1075,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 4,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "mediabox": [
        -0.0,
        -0.0,
        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "Our Vision\nTo be a leading shop for excellent engineering services.\nTo be a leading shop for excellent technicians.\nTo be a leading centre for quality work.\nTo be a leading shop for supply of labour.  \n2\nACTIVE TECHNICIAL \nSERVICES (U) LTD.\nACTIVE TECHNICAL \nSERVICES LTD.\nGIFT 0F GOD\nATS",
      "char_count": 288,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 5,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "mediabox": [
        -0.0,
        -0.0,
        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "Core Values\nIn order to achieve the vision, the company shares the following core values.\n- Accountability.\n- Integrity.\n- Transparency.\n- Diligence.\n- Team Spirit.\n- Loyalty.\n- Eﬃciency.\n3\n",
      "char_count": 189,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 7,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "mediabox": [
        -0.0,
        -0.0,
        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "- Developing and operating a ﬁnancially sound enterprise with proﬁtable growth.\n- To support our clients to achieve success by acting as their trusted service \n  providers.\n- To provide quality, cost eﬀective, personalized and innovative service to meet \n   the changing needs of our clients.\n- To empower our manpower through continuous professional developments to \n  face the dynamic challenges.\nOur Mission\n4\n",
      "char_count": 412,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 5,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "mediabox": [
        -0.0,
        -0.0,
        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "Our Philosophy\n- We are committed to promote high standards of discipline and excellence to \n  aﬃrm quality standards and values.\n- We are dedicated to maintain a strong internal administration, thereby enabling\n  provision of quality services and ensure client satisfaction.\n- At ACTIVE TECHNICAL SERVICES LTD a ‘Customer is a King’ and strongly believe that \n  good relationships with our customers are a prerequisite to our success.    \n5\nACTIVE TECHNICIAL \nSERVICES (U) LTD.\nACTIVE TECHNICAL \nSERVICES LTD.\nGIFT 0F GOD\nATS",
      "char_count": 526,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 3,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "mediabox": [
        -0.0,
        -0.0,
        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "7\nProducts / Services.\nThe company majors in provision of quality services in the area of\n- Labour Supply \n- Welding & Fabrication \n- Structural Works\n- Insulation (Lagging)  \n- Plant Installation which include Machines, Pipe works and Maintenance.\nThe company also provide skilled and semi skilled man power at a market \nfriendly price. \n-The company also does commissioning after the work is done. \n6\nACTIVE TECHNICIAL \nSERVICES (U) LTD.\nACTIVE TECHNICAL \nSERVICES LTD.\nGIFT 0F GOD\nATS",
      "char_count": 487,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 3,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "mediabox": [
        -0.0,
        -0.0,
        595.2756,
        841.8898
      ],
      "rotation": 0,
      "text": "Production\nWe oﬀer ﬁrst class production and our workmanship is of high quality. \nIn order to accomplish and produce quality work we have been able to install \nstate of the equipment.\nThe company also formed a structure of four departments so as to realize \neﬀective service to the clients.\n1. Technical service.\n2. Finance and logistics.\n3. Human resource and administration.\n4. Legal aﬀairs. \nThe company believes that to obtain maximum production from its personnel, \ntheir health and safety must be of a great paramount. However, this can only be \nachieved when the overall working environment is conducive.\nThe company prepare programs to its personnel in which they get relevant \ninformation and are introduced to new tools and equipments that quarante \na safe and healthy working environment which led to high production in the \nshortest period of time.\n \n7",
      "char_count": 864,
      "has_text": true,
      "images_reported": 3,
      "annots": 0,
      "width_pt": 595.2756,
      "height_pt": 841.8898
    },
